# DATABASE_URL is required at runtime (Postgres connection string).
# For local development, copy this file to .env.local and fill in a real
# connection string (.env.local is gitignored, so real secrets never get
# committed). In production (Vercel), set DATABASE_URL as a Project
# Environment Variable instead — do not commit real credentials here.
#
# Example (Supabase connection pooling, recommended for serverless):
# DATABASE_URL="postgresql://postgres.<project-ref>:<password>@aws-0-<region>.pooler.supabase.com:6543/postgres"
